<% require_relative '../../../../lib/api_rate_limit' %>

<h2>Rate limiting</h2>

<p class="article__paragraph">
  Requests are throttled to
  <strong>maximum of <%= ApiRateLimit::LIMIT %> requests every <%= ApiRateLimit::PERIOD %> seconds</strong>.
</p>

<p class="article__paragraph">
  We monitor usage and may adjust these figures over time.
</p>

<p class="article__paragraph">
  Exceeding the limit returns HTTP <code>429 Too Many Requests</code>, with a
  <code>Retry-After</code> header and a JSON error body:
</p>

<pre><code>{ "error": "Rate limit exceeded. Please slow down and try again shortly." }</code></pre>
